@startuml seq-collect-to-map
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

participant "OpenSky API" as O
participant "Collector" as C
database "Local spool" as S
participant "ingest-api" as I
database "PostgreSQL" as D
participant "public-api" as A
participant "Web app" as W

C -> O : get all positions (every 90 s)
O --> C : positions
C -> S : save batch first
C -> I : upload batch over Tailscale
I -> D : store, skipping duplicates
alt snapshot under 10 minutes old
  D --> A : new snapshot
  A --> W : live update (SSE)
  W -> A : fetch snapshot
  A --> W : aircraft positions
else old batch after an outage
  note over I, D : stored only, the map is not disturbed
end
I --> C : confirmed
C -> S : mark batch as sent
note over C, S
  If the upload fails, the batch stays
  in the spool and is retried later.
end note
@enduml
